sequenceDiagram
  %% Target design: ADR 0244 task + gateway-root-of-trust-keys (Gateway signs) + single-swamp-node; DECISIONS R2 (state from terminal result) + 2 (DNS held).
  %% status: draft
  autonumber
  %% lane CLI icon=terminal pill=caller tone=gray
  %% lane GW icon=gateway pill=intent tone=blue
  %% lane SW icon=workflow pill=executes tone=green
  %% lane N icon=server pill=target tone=amber
  participant CLI as CLI / MCP<br/>orbit · MCP tools
  participant GW as Gateway<br/>Laravel API
  participant SW as Swamp<br/>serve on Node 209
  participant N as Route Node<br/>Caddy over ssh
  CLI->>GW: route:target:set<br/>{route: 14, instance: 42}
  Note over GW: Guard, record task only<br/>targets unchanged · target_set
  GW->>SW: Start run, full intent<br/>operation-route-target-set
  GW-->>CLI: 202 Accepted<br/>task #5140
  SW->>N: Prepare workload, CSR<br/>instance-route-workload
  SW->>GW: Ask to sign the CSR<br/>certificate-sign primitive
  GW-->>SW: Signed leaf<br/>Orbit CA stays in Gateway
  SW->>N: Stage site, probe TLS<br/>cluster-router-probe
  SW->>N: Publish Caddy, PHP, URLs<br/>route-mutation-forward
  Note over SW: DNS publication held<br/>native-dns-takeover-held
  alt all steps succeed
    SW-->>GW: Run succeeded<br/>terminal event + outputs
    Note over GW: Write the new targets<br/>from terminal result · active
  else a step fails
    Note over SW: Restore prior state<br/>route-mutation-restore
    SW--xGW: Run failed<br/>route.target_set_failed
    Note over GW: Old targets kept<br/>task failed
  end
  loop every 2 s until terminal
    CLI->>GW: operation:show #5140
    GW-->>CLI: status + result
  end
